    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong><i>Drift Survivors</i></strong>, a fast-paced fusion of adrenaline-fueled drifting and chaotic survival combat! Take control of a sleek, high-performance car in a top-down arena where every corner, boost, and shot counts. Fight through relentless waves of enemies, upgrade your ride, and prove you\u2019re the ultimate Drift Survivor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399940/extras/55ed03d45ef98204641cfd2cca6cea9b.poster.avif?t=1750320284\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399940/extras/55ed03d45ef98204641cfd2cca6cea9b.webm?t=1750320284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399940/extras/55ed03d45ef98204641cfd2cca6cea9b.mp4?t=1750320284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Art of Drifting:</strong> Slide through tight turns and outmaneuver your enemies while maintaining control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Deadly Arsenal:</strong> Equip your car with powerful weapons like Homing Rockets, Tron Lines, Ricochet Guns, and Bombardments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Ride:</strong> Boost your car\u2019s speed, armor, and unique abilities to dominate the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Japanese-Inspired Map:</strong> Drift through visually stunning zones featuring sakura blossoms, neon lights, and tight corners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive Endless Waves:</strong> Face hordes of enemies, from drones to elite bosses, all trying to take you down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the Groove with Custom Phonk Music:</strong> Immerse yourself in the game with a killer soundtrack featuring original phonk tracks composed exclusively for <i>Drift Survivors</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play Drift Survivors?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re a fan of games like <i>Vampire Survivors</i> but crave a high-octane racing twist, <i>Drift Survivors</i> delivers the perfect blend of strategy, action, and style. Feel the rush of dodging enemy attacks, pulling off epic drifts, and obliterating foes in your path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are You Ready to Survive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the driver\u2019s seat and see if you have what it takes to survive the chaos. Drift your way to glory, or crash trying!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong><i>Drift Survivors</i></strong>, a fast-paced fusion of adrenaline-fueled drifting and chaotic survival combat! Take control of a sleek, high-performance car in a top-down arena where every corner, boost, and shot counts. Fight through relentless waves of enemies, upgrade your ride, and prove you\u2019re the ultimate Drift Survivor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399940/extras/55ed03d45ef98204641cfd2cca6cea9b.poster.avif?t=1750320284\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399940/extras/55ed03d45ef98204641cfd2cca6cea9b.webm?t=1750320284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399940/extras/55ed03d45ef98204641cfd2cca6cea9b.mp4?t=1750320284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Art of Drifting:</strong> Slide through tight turns and outmaneuver your enemies while maintaining control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Deadly Arsenal:</strong> Equip your car with powerful weapons like Homing Rockets, Tron Lines, Ricochet Guns, and Bombardments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Ride:</strong> Boost your car\u2019s speed, armor, and unique abilities to dominate the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Japanese-Inspired Map:</strong> Drift through visually stunning zones featuring sakura blossoms, neon lights, and tight corners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive Endless Waves:</strong> Face hordes of enemies, from drones to elite bosses, all trying to take you down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the Groove with Custom Phonk Music:</strong> Immerse yourself in the game with a killer soundtrack featuring original phonk tracks composed exclusively for <i>Drift Survivors</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play Drift Survivors?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re a fan of games like <i>Vampire Survivors</i> but crave a high-octane racing twist, <i>Drift Survivors</i> delivers the perfect blend of strategy, action, and style. Feel the rush of dodging enemy attacks, pulling off epic drifts, and obliterating foes in your path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are You Ready to Survive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the driver\u2019s seat and see if you have what it takes to survive the chaos. Drift your way to glory, or crash trying!</p>",
